# The recipient's files are Windows files: cmd.exe and Notepad want CRLF. Checked
# out with CRLF whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine that packs the zip, a
# developer's or a GitHub Actions runner. Stored with LF, as they are now.
delivery/*.cmd text eol=crlf
delivery/*.ps1 text eol=crlf
delivery/*.txt text eol=crlf
